        "message": "Revert the status relay: the publication itself is delayed\n\nDecisive forensics across the retained trials: the watchdog's status\npublication inside the console server lags physics by p95 ~575 ms in\nbursts while the fixture's receive path is fast (median 0.5 ms) - the\ncamera image serving on the console server's shared gz transport blocks\nthe status publication itself. No transport relay can help, and the\nfresh-process relay received nothing anyway. Reverts the wiring and\nremoves the relay. Retains series 16 trial 1."
